  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2a2d42;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --accent: #ff6b6b;\n  --accent-hover: #ff8e8e;\n  --accent-active: #e05555;\n  --border: #4a4d68;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  min-width: 4rem;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  background: var(--accent-active);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n    min-width: 3.5rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is 0\n- Increase button adds 1\n- Decrease button subtracts 1 (supports negative numbers)\n- Reset button sets count back to 0\n- Output element with ID `count` displays the current integer\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width\n- Pixel-art inspired styling using CSS (no external assets)\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab to focus and Enter/Space to activate them.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup and structure\n- `styles.css` – pixel-style theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` – counter logic with event listeners\n\n## Technical Details\n\n- No external libraries or frameworks\n- Event listeners attached via `addEventListener`\n- Buttons have `aria-label` attributes for accessibility\n- Total source lines under 200\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
